alls proc~~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build~~CallsGraph proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build info info proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->info proc~agglom_level_destroy agglom_level_unstr_t%agglom_level_destroy proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~agglom_level_destroy proc~aggregate_and_build_coarse aggregate_and_build_coarse proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~aggregate_and_build_coarse proc~alloc_level_coeffs alloc_level_coeffs proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~alloc_level_coeffs proc~build_level1_structure build_level1_structure proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~build_level1_structure proc~galerkin_operator galerkin_operator proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~galerkin_operator proc~itoa itoa proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~itoa proc~level1_operator level1_operator proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~level1_operator proc~trim_levels trim_levels proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~trim_levels cursor cursor proc~aggregate_and_build_coarse->cursor proc~build_coarse_adjacency build_coarse_adjacency proc~aggregate_and_build_coarse->proc~build_coarse_adjacency proc~find_slot find_slot proc~galerkin_operator->proc~find_slot proc~move_level move_level proc~trim_levels->proc~move_level proc~push_unique push_unique proc~build_coarse_adjacency->proc~push_unique proc~find_slot->proc~itoa error error proc~find_slot->error Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are