x_sq / speed_sq ) hu ( i , j ) = hu ( i , j ) * fr_scale hv ( i , j ) = hv ( i , j ) * fr_scale end if end if end do end subroutine compute_update","tags":"","url":"proc/compute_update.html"},{"title":"parse_remap_method – Rakali","text":"public pure function parse_remap_method(str) result(method) Convert a namelist string to a REMAP_* constant. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: str Return Value integer Called by proc~~parse_remap_method~~CalledByGraph proc~parse_remap_method parse_remap_method proc~state_init_from_config state_t%state_init_from_config proc~state_init_from_config->proc~parse_remap_method proc~init_local_state init_local_state proc~init_local_state->proc~state_init_from_config proc~rki_create rki_create proc~rki_create->proc~state_init_from_config proc~rki_create_from_string rki_create_from_string proc~rki_create_from_string->proc~state_init_from_config proc~driver_run_coastal driver_run_coastal proc~driver_run_coastal->proc~init_local_state proc~rki_create_from_namelist rki_create_from_namelist proc~rki_create_from_namelist->proc~rki_create proc~rki_create_from_namelist_string rki_create_from_namelist_string proc~rki_create_from_namelist_string->proc~rki_create_from_string proc~driver_run driver_run proc~driver_run->proc~driver_run_coastal Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge gr