ating ghost stage at boundary edge `i` of !! cell `k`. Advects the persistent `chapman_eta_old(i, k)` toward !! the interior centroid stage along the phase speed, writes back !! the new `eta_old`, and returns `eta_target` as the BC_TIDAL !! ghost eta. Per-edge writes to `chapman_eta_old(i, k)` are !! race-free: each (i, k) is touched only by cell `k`. type ( unstr_state_t ), intent ( inout ) :: state type ( mesh_unstr_t ), intent ( in ) :: mesh integer , intent ( in ) :: k , i real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: hle real ( wp ), intent ( out ) :: eta_target real ( wp ) :: eta_int , eta_at_edge , eta_old_val real ( wp ) :: deta_dt , deta_dn , c_phase , d_perp , edge_len , dt_local real ( wp ), parameter :: H_FLOOR = 1.0e-6_wp real ( wp ), parameter :: GRAD_FLOOR = 1.0e-10_wp eta_int = state % barotropic % stage_cv ( k ) eta_at_edge = state % barotropic % stage_ev ( i , k ) eta_old_val = state % barotropic % chapman_eta_old ( i , k ) dt_local = state % dt edge_len = mesh % edge_len ( i , k ) if ( edge_len > 0.0_wp . and . mesh % area ( k ) > 0.0_wp ) then d_perp = 2.0_wp * mesh % area ( k ) / ( 3.0_wp * edge_len ) else d_perp = 0.0_wp end if if ( dt_local > 0.0_wp . and . d_perp > 0.0_wp ) then deta_dt = ( eta_int - eta_old_val ) / dt_local deta_dn = ( eta_int - eta_at_edge ) / d_perp ! along inward normal if ( abs ( deta_dn ) > GRAD_FLOOR ) then c_phase = - deta_dt / deta_dn else c_phase = 0.0_wp end if c_phase = max ( 0.0_wp , min ( c_phase , sqrt ( GRAVITY * max ( hle , H_FLOOR )))) eta_target = eta_old_val - c_phase * dt_local / d_perp * & ( eta_old_val - eta_int ) else ! First step or degenerate triangle -- seed with interior eta. eta_target = eta_int end if state % barotropic % chapman_eta_old ( i , k ) = eta_int end subroutine compute_chapman_eta_target","tags":"","url":"proc/compute_chapman_eta_target.html"},{"title":"compute_velocity_terms_impl – Rakali","text":"private pure subroutine compute_velocity_terms_impl(h, h_edge, uh_raw, vh_raw, u, uh, v, vh) Arguments T