iscosity to layer momentum by !! an implicit (Thomas) vertical-diffusion sweep.  No-flux at bed/surface !! (wind + bottom drag are separate kernels), conserves the column total. type ( unstr_state_t ), intent ( inout ) :: state real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: dt if (. not . state % use_multilayer ) return if ( state % multilayer % nz_ml < 2 ) return if (. not . allocated ( state % multilayer % keps_nut )) return call ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl ( state % multilayer % nz_ml , state % ncells_owned , & state % multilayer % h_layer , state % multilayer % hu_layer , & state % multilayer % hv_layer , state % multilayer % keps_nut , & state % barotropic % height_cv , dt ) end subroutine ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr","tags":"","url":"proc/ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr.html"},{"title":"ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl – Rakali","text":"public pure subroutine ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl(nz, n, h_layer, hu_layer, hv_layer, nut, height_cv, dt) Per-cell implicit vertical diffusion of momentum on flat explicit-shape\narrays.  Implicit (not the explicit PP81 clamp) – the keps nu_t can\nreach NUT_MAX.  One factorisation, two RHS (u, v). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer, intent(in) :: nz integer, intent(in) :: n real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: h_layer (nz,n) real(kind=wp), intent(inout) :: hu_layer (nz,n) real(kind=wp), intent(inout) :: hv_layer (nz,n) real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: nut (nz+1,n) real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: height_cv (n) real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: dt Calls proc~~ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl~~CallsGraph proc~ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl local local proc~ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl->local proc~keps_tridiag_solve_noflux_u keps_tridiag_solve_noflux_u proc~ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl->proc~keps_tridiag_solve_noflux_u Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Proc