ish in\nlarge graphs. Variables Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial real(kind=wp), private :: a (BPG_NZ_MAX) real(kind=wp), private :: b (BPG_NZ_MAX) real(kind=wp), private :: c (BPG_NZ_MAX) real(kind=wp), private :: cd integer, private :: cell real(kind=wp), private :: cp (BPG_NZ_MAX) real(kind=wp), private :: cu real(kind=wp), private :: dz_dn real(kind=wp), private :: dz_up real(kind=wp), private :: h_dn real(kind=wp), private :: h_k real(kind=wp), private :: h_up integer, private :: k real(kind=wp), private :: ru (BPG_NZ_MAX) real(kind=wp), private :: rv (BPG_NZ_MAX) Source Code pure subroutine ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl ( nz , n , h_layer , hu_layer , hv_layer , & nut , height_cv , dt ) !! Per-cell implicit vertical diffusion of momentum on flat explicit-shape !! arrays.  Implicit (not the explicit PP81 clamp) -- the keps nu_t can !! reach NUT_MAX.  One factorisation, two RHS (u, v). integer , intent ( in ) :: nz , n real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: h_layer ( nz , n ) real ( wp ), intent ( inout ) :: hu_layer ( nz , n ), hv_layer ( nz , n ) real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: nut ( nz + 1 , n ), height_cv ( n ) real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: dt integer :: cell , k real ( wp ) :: h_k , h_dn , h_up , dz_dn , dz_up , cd , cu real ( wp ) :: a ( BPG_NZ_MAX ), b ( BPG_NZ_MAX ), c ( BPG_NZ_MAX ) real ( wp ) :: ru ( BPG_NZ_MAX ), rv ( BPG_NZ_MAX ), cp ( BPG_NZ_MAX ) do concurrent ( cell = 1 : n ) & local ( k , h_k , h_dn , h_up , dz_dn , dz_up , cd , cu , a , b , c , ru , rv , cp ) if ( height_cv ( cell ) >= ML_MIN_DEPTH_UNSTR ) then do k = 1 , nz h_k = h_layer ( k , cell ) if ( h_k > VANISHING_LAYER_TOL_UNSTR ) then cd = 0.0_wp if ( k > 1 ) then h_dn = h_layer ( k - 1 , cell ) dz_dn = 0.5_wp * ( h_dn + h_k ) if ( h_dn > VANISHING_LAYER_TOL_UNSTR ) cd = dt * nut ( k , cell ) / ( h_k * dz_dn ) end if cu = 0.0_wp if ( k < nz ) then h_up = h_layer ( k + 1 , cell ) dz_up = 0.5_wp * ( h_k + h_up ) if ( h_up > VANISHING_LAYER_TOL_UNSTR ) cu = dt * nut ( k + 1 , cell ) / ( h_k * dz_up ) end if a ( k ) = - cd c ( k ) = - cu b ( k ) = 1.0_wp + cd + cu ru ( k ) = hu_layer ( k , cell ) / h_k rv ( k ) = hv_layer ( k , cell ) / h_k else a ( k ) = 0.0_wp c ( k ) = 0.0_wp b ( k ) = 1.0_wp if ( h_k > 0.0_wp ) then ru ( k ) = hu_layer ( k , cell ) / h_k rv ( k ) = hv_layer ( k , cell ) / h_k else ru ( k ) = 0.0_wp rv ( k ) = 0.0_wp end if end if end do call keps_tridiag_solve_noflux_u ( a , b , c , ru , cp , nz ) call keps_tridiag_solve_noflux_u ( a , b , c , rv , cp , nz ) do k = 1 , nz hu_layer ( k , cell ) = ru ( k ) * h_layer ( k , cell ) hv_layer ( k , cell ) = rv ( k ) * h_layer ( k , cell ) end do end if end do end subroutine ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl","tags":"","url":"proc/ml_keps_apply_momentum_unstr_impl.html"},{"title":"ml_keps_friction_velocities_unstr – Rakali","text":"public pure subroutine ml_keps_friction_velocities_unstr(state) Per-cell surface + bed friction velocities feeding the keps wall\nfunctions.  Surface: u_ s = sqrt(|tau_wind|/rho_0) from the (uniform)\nunstructured wind stress.  Bed: quadratic Manning u_ b = sqrt(C_d)*|u_b|,\nC_d = g n&#94;2 / H&#94;(1/3), from the bottom (k=1) layer speed.  Writes\nkeps_ustar_s/b on the multilayer state. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( unstr_state_t ), intent(inout) :: state Calls proc~~ml_keps_friction_velocities_unstr~~CallsGraph proc~ml_keps_friction_velocities_unstr ml_keps_friction_velocities_unstr local local proc~ml_keps_friction_velocities_unstr->local Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplemen