total nx = grid % nx_total ny = grid % ny_total nghost = grid % nghost do concurrent ( j = nghost + 1 : ny - nghost , i = nghost + 1 : nx - nghost ) & local ( k , total ) total = 0.0_wp do k = 1 , nz total = total + h_layer ( i , j , k ) end do h ( i , j ) = total end do end subroutine ml_compute_total_depth","tags":"","url":"proc/ml_compute_total_depth.html"},{"title":"ml_compute_vertical_exchange – Rakali","text":"public pure subroutine ml_compute_vertical_exchange(h_layer, hu_layer, hv_layer, w, grid, nz, dt) Vertical momentum exchange using upwind advection at layer interfaces.\nTransfers momentum between adjacent layers based on diagnostic w. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: h_layer (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz) real(kind=wp), intent(inout) :: hu_layer (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz) real(kind=wp), intent(inout) :: hv_layer (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz) real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: w (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz+1) type( hgrid_t ), intent(in) :: grid integer, intent(in) :: nz real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: dt Calls proc~~ml_compute_vertical_exchange~~CallsGraph proc~ml_compute_vertical_exchange ml_compute_vertical_exchange local local proc~ml_compute_vertical_exchange->local Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Called by proc~~ml_compute_vertical_exchange~~CalledByGraph proc~m