loud allowlist: an unknown tag aborts.  MG is !! aggregation (agglomeration) multigrid here (`rki_si_unstr_mg`) — the !! triangle plateau-breaker — NOT the structured geometric MG. character ( len =* ), intent ( in ) :: tag integer :: precond select case ( trim ( adjustl ( tag ))) case ( \"none\" , \"NONE\" , \"\" ) precond = SI_PRECOND_NONE case ( \"jacobi\" , \"JACOBI\" ) precond = SI_PRECOND_JACOBI case ( \"mg\" , \"MG\" ) precond = SI_PRECOND_MG case default call global_logger % error ( \"si_precond (unstructured): unknown \" // & \"preconditioner '\" // trim ( adjustl ( tag )) // & \"' (allowed: none, jacobi, mg)\" ) error stop \"si_precond: unknown preconditioner\" end select end function parse_si_precond_unstr","tags":"","url":"proc/parse_si_precond_unstr.html"},{"title":"si_unstr_state_build_mg – Rakali","text":"private  subroutine si_unstr_state_build_mg(this, mesh) Build the aggregation-MG preconditioner hierarchy for this state.\nHost-only; call from enable_si (after init , before enter_data )\nwhen precond == SI_PRECOND_MG .  Structure only (geometric\naggregation); the operator coefficients are filled by the first\nper-step refresh . Type Bound semi_implicit_state_unstr_t Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( semi_implicit_state_unstr_t ), intent(inout) :: this type( mesh_unstr_t ), intent(in) :: mesh Calls proc~~si_unstr_state_build_mg~~CallsGraph proc~si_unstr_state_build_mg semi_implicit_state_unstr_t%si_unstr_state_build_mg proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build proc~si_unstr_state_build_mg->proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build info info proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->info proc~agglom_level_destroy agglom_level_unstr_t%agglom_level_destroy proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~agglom_level_destroy proc~aggregate_and_build_coarse aggregate_and_build_coarse proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~aggregate_and_build_coarse proc~alloc_level_coeffs alloc_level_coeffs proc~agglom_hierarchy_unstr_build->proc~allo