entation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Subroutines recursive subroutine quicksort (lo, hi) Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer, intent(in) :: lo integer, intent(in) :: hi Source Code subroutine sort_by_key ( keys , payload1 , payload2 ) !! In-place quicksort keeping two integer payload arrays in lockstep !! with the int64 key array. Mesh-init only. integer ( int64 ), intent ( inout ) :: keys (:) integer , intent ( inout ) :: payload1 (:) integer , intent ( inout ) :: payload2 (:) call quicksort ( 1 , size ( keys )) contains recursive subroutine quicksort ( lo , hi ) integer , intent ( in ) :: lo , hi integer :: i , j integer ( int64 ) :: pivot , tmpk integer :: tmp1 , tmp2 if ( lo >= hi ) return pivot = keys (( lo + hi ) / 2 ) i = lo j = hi do do while ( keys ( i ) < pivot ) i = i + 1 end do do while ( keys ( j ) > pivot ) j = j - 1 end do if ( i <= j ) then tmpk = keys ( i ) keys ( i ) = keys ( j ) keys ( j ) = tmpk tmp1 = payload1 ( i ) payload1 ( i ) = payload1 ( j ) payload1 ( j ) = tmp1 tmp2 = payload2 ( i ) payload2 ( i ) = payload2 ( j ) payload2 ( j ) = tmp2 i = i + 1 j = j - 1 end if if ( i > j ) exit end do if ( lo < j ) call quicksort ( lo , j ) if ( i < hi ) call quicksort ( i , hi ) end subroutine quicksort end subroutine sort_by_key","tags":"","url":"proc/sort_by_key.html"},{"title":"bc_type_from_string – Rakali","text":"public pure function bc_type_from_string(name) result(bc_type) Convert boundary type string to integer constant Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: name Return Value integer Called by proc~~bc_type_from_string~~CalledByGraph proc~bc_type_from_string bc_type_from_string proc~bc_init_from_config bc_init_from_config proc~bc_init_from_config->proc~bc_type_from_string proc~init_bc_from_config init_bc_from_config proc~init_bc_from_config->pr