 edge_prescribes (edge_type) result(prescribes) An edge accepts a prescribed inflow tracer value when it is an\ninflow (BC_INFLOW) or a Dirichlet-eta OPEN edge (BC_TIDAL /\nBC_CLAMPED) — the edges through which water can enter the domain\ncarrying a specified concentration.  The prescription still only\ntakes effect when tr_inflow >= 0 (checked at the call site), and the\nprescribed ghost is only READ on inflow (upwind), so a reversing\ntidal edge is inflow-value on flood and zero-gradient on ebb. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer, intent(in) :: edge_type Return Value logical Subroutines public pure subroutine ml_advect_tracer (h_layer, hu_layer, hv_layer, mass_flux_x, mass_flux_y, hTr_layer, adv_hTr_snap, grid, nz, dt) Per-layer horizontal advection of a scalar tracer hTr = h*Tr\nusing first-order upwind reconstruction. Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: h_layer (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz) real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: hu_layer (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz) real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: hv_layer (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz) real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: mass_flux_x (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total) real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: mass_flux_y (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total) real(kind=wp), intent(inout) :: hTr_layer (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz) real(kind=wp), intent(out) :: adv_hTr_snap (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz) Caller-owned Jacobi snapshot scratch (filled then read here). type( hgrid_t ), intent(in) :: grid integer, intent(in) :: nz real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: dt public pure subroutine ml_advect_tracer_ppm (h_layer, hu_layer, hv_layer, mass_flux_x, mass_flux_y, hTr_layer, ppm_tr_snap, ppm_ql_x, ppm_qr_x, ppm_ql_y, ppm_qr_y, grid, nz, dt) Per-layer horizontal advection of a scalar tracer using the\nPiecewise Parabolic Method (Colella & Woodward 1984). Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: h_layer (grid%nx_total,grid%ny_total,nz) real(k