art of `path` with a trailing '/', or '' if none. character ( len =* ), intent ( in ) :: path character ( len = :), allocatable :: dir integer :: i dir = \"\" do i = len_trim ( path ), 1 , - 1 if ( path ( i : i ) == \"/\" ) then dir = path ( 1 : i ) return end if end do end function nml_dirname end module rki_config_schema","tags":"","url":"sourcefile/rki_config_schema.f90.html"},{"title":"rki_eos.F90 – Rakali","text":"Ocean equation-of-state state + kernel. This file depends on sourcefile~~rki_eos.f90~~EfferentGraph sourcefile~rki_eos.f90 rki_eos.F90 sourcefile~rki_constants.f90 rki_constants.F90 sourcefile~rki_eos.f90->sourcefile~rki_constants.f90 sourcefile~rki_grid.f90 rki_grid.F90 sourcefile~rki_eos.f90->sourcefile~rki_grid.f90 sourcefile~rki_grid.f90->sourcefile~rki_constants.f90 Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Source File Source File This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a file to a file which it depends on. A file\nis dependent upon another if the latter must be compiled before the former\ncan be. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Files dependent on this one sourcefile~~rki_eos.f90~~AfferentGraph sourcefile~rki_eos.f90 rki_eos.F90 sourcefile~rki_ml_eos.f90 rki_ml_eos.F90 sourcefile~rki_ml_eos.f90->sourcefile~rki_eos.f90 sourcefile~rki_ml_eos_unstr.f90 rki_ml_eos_unstr.F90 sourcefile~rki_ml_eos_unstr.f90->sourcefile~rki_eos.f90 sourcefile~rki_state_unstr.f90 rki_state_unstr.F90 sourcefile~rki_ml_eos_unstr.f90->sourcefile~rki_state_unstr.f90 sourcefile~rki_multilayer_state.f90 rki_multilayer_state.F90 sourcefile~rki_multilayer_state.f90->sourcefile~rki_eos.f90 sourcefile~rki_multilayer_state_unstr.f90 rki_multilayer_state_unstr.F90 sourcefile~rki_multilayer_state_unstr.f90->sourcefile~rki_eos.f90 sourcefile~rki_driver.f90 rki_driver.F90 sourcefile~rki_driver.f90->sourcefile~rki_ml_eos.f90 sourcefile~rki_ini